{'symbol': 'MHK', 'date': '2023-04-27 16:10:00', 'title': 'MOHAWK INDUSTRIES REPORTS Q1 RESULTS', 'text': 'CALHOUN, GA., APRIL 27, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MOHAWK INDUSTRIES, INC. (NYSE: MHK) TODAY ANNOUNCED FIRST QUARTER 2023 NET EARNINGS OF $80 MILLION AND DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE (EPS) OF $1.26. ADJUSTED NET EARNINGS WERE $112 MILLION, AND ADJUSTED EPS WAS $1.75, EXCLUDING RESTRUCTURING, ACQUISITION AND OTHER CHARGES. NET SALES FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2023 WERE $2.8 BILLION, A DECREASE OF 6.9% AS REPORTED AND 5.9% ON A CONSTANT CURRENCY AND DAYS BASIS. FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2022, NET SALES WERE $3.0 BILLION, NET EARNINGS WERE $245 MILLION AND EPS WAS $3.78. ADJUSTED NET EARNINGS WERE $246 MILLION, AND ADJUSTED EPS WAS $3.78, EXCLUDING RESTRUCTURING, ACQUISITION AND OTHER CHARGES.'}